er\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kLnFzCelnRz1jne83MKPVvwhmeb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kN5blJAcmGvHgYZig0X55W05EB4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Steven Seagal stars in this gritty, no-holds barred action film as an elite ex-cop with a gambling problem and a mountain of debt. When a mysterious man offers to clear his debts in exchange for the assassination of the city's most notorious gangsters, he make s decision that will change his life - forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1235769,\"title\":\"The Journey to Gyeong-ju\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eBoSfJq9JtsEO7KwInC3oQXYSxP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AnsHGXWGBZBppDuYzLarXOOeL1u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Eight years ago, the youngest daughter, Gyeong-ju, disappeared during a school field trip to Gyeongju and never came home alive.  On what would have been her birthday, her mother Ok-sil and her three daughters—Jang-ju, Young-ju, and Dong-ju—put on matching family T-shirts and set off for Gyeongju, the place where Gyeong-ju vanished, in what appears to be a family trip to honor her memory. But beneath the cheerful façade lies a deadly secret. In the trunk of their van is a bound and unconscious man zipped inside a plastic bag.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1538,\"title\":\"Collateral\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nV5316WUsVij8sVXLCF1g7TFitg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qVzmXKKOTtd3szkiCheCNrfa394.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cab driver Max picks up a man who offers him $600 to drive him around. But the promise of easy money sours when Max realizes his fare is an assassin.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":979,\"title\":\"Irreversible\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rxeDxo8FvZpLu6iplNpxdtAVnfu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xV1EfNSEg6id6juJPr1vM6p9x5X.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman’s lover and her ex-boyfriend take justice into their own hands after she becomes the victim of a rapist. Because some acts can’t be undone. Because man is an animal. Because the desire for vengeance is a natural impulse. Because most crimes remain unpunished.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":956,\"title\":\"Mission: Impossible III\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vKGYCpmQyV9uHybWDzXuII8Los5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bYKeB9uUcPmvikjouEEQ86uvPw9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Retired from active duty, and training recruits for the Impossible Mission Force, agent Ethan Hunt faces the toughest foe of his career: Owen Davian, an international broker of arms and information, who's as cunning as he is ruthless. Davian emerges to threaten Hunt and all that he holds dear – including the woman Hunt loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2239,\"title\":\"Hallam Foe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2RzhxbVNu4BaPx0ETCiuNUpjJf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n0b9FqOTm58LUaDjeluVim3WBJ1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hallam's talent for spying on people reveals his darkest fears-and his most peculiar desires. Driven to expose the true cause of his mother's death, he instead finds himself searching the rooftops of the city for love.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":842,\"title\":\"The Assassination of Richard Nixon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5jOOvAVvP0XtwC5yYQpQCy4cjq1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mhMBrMEzG7eMVmOeBSmZUjH5Yu0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It’s 1974 and Sam Bicke has lost everything. His wife leaves him with his three kids, his boss fires him, his brother turns away from him, and the bank won’t give him any money to start anew. He tries to find someone to blame for his misfortunes and comes up with the President of the United States who he plans to murder.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1537,\"title\":\"Changing Lanes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wh9WzTKo5pJw3EgHYWA60W7Kbl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lCPOmWoqtmVrI2yUNUw8iaOaTJn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City's crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn't set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people's lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other's life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"333cCxNembY\",\"name\":\"Darkland (2017) Official Trailer (HD)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}